dialogs
0	No one believes me, but I saw this gigantic POKéMON in the sky.It seemed to squirm as it flew toward ROUTE 131.By the way… Sniff… Um… You, uh…smell singed.Were you at a volcano or something?
1	The ground absorbs rainwater, and trees grow by drinking that water…Our FORTREE CITY exists because there's both water and soil.
2	I want to go to the POKéMON GYM, but something's blocking the way.After all the bother I went through training on ROUTE 120…
3	Living on top of trees is okay.But sometimes BUG POKéMON come in through windows. It can be really startling.
4	The CITY consists of homes built on trees.Perhaps because of that lifestyle, everyone is healthy and lively.Why, even myself--I feel as if I've grown thirty years younger.
5	There are POKéMON that evolve when you trade them! That's what I heard.
6	Something unseeable is in the way.
